>**Angelica's path**
* If you chose {n:Angelica}, go to {z:Windurst Waters} North on the top floor of the Rarab Tail Hostelry (F-10) to speak to her. She will ask you for a {i:Bal Shell|Bal Shell|1838}. Use a {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} at an Excavation Point in {z:Korroloka Tunnel} to get a {i:Bal Shell|Bal Shell|1838}, then return Windurst Waters to trade the {i:Bal Shell|Bal Shell|1838} to {n:Angelica}. She ask for a {k:Opalescent stone} from {z:Castle Oztroja}.
* In {z:Castle Oztroja}, go past the Brass Door at (I-8) to go to map two, then use the exit at (I-9) to map 6. Examine the Brass Door at (I-8) for a brief cutscene, then click it again to enter. Inside of the room there is a ??? spot, examine it to spawn a NM named {m:Yagudo Muralist} and your Adventuring Fellow. Once you defeat the NM, speak to your Adventuring Fellow, then examine the ??? spot again to get the key item.
** There is a 3 minute wait before another player may spawn the {m:Yagudo Muralist} after it has been defeated.
* Return to {z:Windurst Waters} and speak to {n:Angelica} to receive the key item {k:Old woman's portrait}. Take it to {z:Bastok Markets} (L-10) and speak to {n:Umberto} for a cutscene that completes the quest.

>**Umberto's path**
